ame. It it just outside.\n- Cosmetics: It has all the cosmetics and a few computers so you can change what people see you as in game.\n- Beach: Relax in the beach!\n- Horror: Run away from the monster as fast as you can!\n\n# Better Features\n\n- More maps\n- More gamemodes\n- An LIV camera\n- Music\n- More!", "short_description": "Otisdub Tag Plus is Otisdub Tag, but better! With more maps, gamemodes, music, and cosmetics, Otisdub Tag Plus provides a better experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://otagplus.otisdub.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "OtisdubYT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://otagplus.otisdub.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "33826638130313182"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819934_738028586012339_1398093147334964612_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Auvmuz3ZLRUQ7kNvwGKwZVX&_nc_oc=Adn4fXdurftXR5C-Rq4HOTapC0eX92MCL9F-QZwIkaKfYQu-emksrZHwk6oga_3CXMo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsfvWA9jWvskO7Vkm0zNeuMPWu5Upth43Z7vPbyZDxQCg&oe=69A1AC97"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Otisdub Tag Plus